<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-QUEENSLAND BEAT OTAGO 37-24 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-QUEENSLAND BEAT OTAGO 37-24 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland beat Otago Highlanders 37-24 (halftime 31-10) in a Super 12 rugby union match at Ballymore on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Queensland - Tries: Elton Flatley, Jason Little, Ben Tune, Matt Cockbain. Conversions. John Eales (4). Penalties: Eales (3).</p>
<p>Otago Highlanders - Tries: Jeff Wilson, Matthew Carrington, penalty try. Conversions: Simon Culhane (3). Penalty: Culhane.</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,286</p>
